<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46080" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">substantĭālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		substantia. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the essence</i> or <i>substance</i>, <i>essential</i>, <i>substantial</i> (post - class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">differentia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Res. Carn. 45 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>substantial</i>,
				<i>substantive</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">potestates,</span>”
				i. e. <i>spirits</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 21, 1, 8</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sub-stantĭālĭter</span></b> , <i>essentially</i>, <i>substantially</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Valent. 7,
			4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. adv. Marc. 35 <i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
